V1.12.0 Release

<b>Changes</b>

* Changes system command CAN IDs. This version of firmware is compatible with ECU firmware version 1.36 or newer.

* Updates the boot code to support update over CAN. This requires a one-off firmware upgrade to PD16 through USB.

<b>Fixes</b>

* Fix HBO leds not lighting up correctly.

* Fix SPI frequency reporting incorrectly above 8192Hz.
